Subject: [PATCH 12/12] amd-event-log: add Redfish projection support

Add AMD Redfish projection support for AMD Event Log
(AEL) runtime metadata.

The implementation converts runtime AEL metadata into
AMD Redfish payloads and integrates projection support
with the runtime metadata provider. Event metadata is
combined with platform metadata and projected into the
final AMD OEM payload representation.

Support producer supplied Redfish payload overrides
through AEL.REDFISH and add utility helpers used by
the Redfish projection layer.

Also add unit tests covering AMD Redfish payload
generation and projection behavior.

Change-Id: I9bc8dd9b9097726fe1feb4d2c253756a8a061700
Signed-off-by: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
